/F1 6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 756 Tm () Tj
/F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 744 Tm (0. Background) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 725 Tm (Lumen completes about 41,000 studies a month across CT, MRI, ultrasound and X-ray.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 709 Tm (Reports are dictated by 22 radiologists and finalised in the radiology information) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 693 Tm (system. Referring doctors receive the report through a portal or by fax, and the care) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 677 Tm (coordination team of seven people handles scheduling questions by phone.) Tj
/F1 6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 661 Tm () Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 649 Tm (The medical advisory board has asked for evidence that automated support can make) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 633 Tm (follow-up tracking safer without adding work for radiologists, who are already under) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 617 Tm (time pressure.) Tj
/F1 6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 601 Tm () Tj
/F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 589 Tm (1. Summary) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 570 Tm (Lumen Imaging Partners \(fictional\) operates six outpatient imaging centres. Radiologists) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 554 Tm (sometimes recommend follow-up imaging in a report, for example a repeat scan of a small) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 538 Tm (lung nodule in six months. These recommendations are buried in free text and are often) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 522 Tm (not acted on. This healthcare brief asks for a proof of concept that finds these) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 506 Tm (recommendations and tracks them to completion. Contact: informatics@lumen-) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 490 Tm (imaging.example.com.) Tj
/F1 6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 474 Tm () Tj
/F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 462 Tm (2. Problem) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 443 Tm (About 11 percent of reports contain a follow-up recommendation. An internal audit of 400) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 427 Tm (reports found that 27 percent of recommended follow-ups had no scheduled appointment) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 411 Tm (after 90 days.) Tj
/F1 6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 395 Tm () Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 383 Tm (Missed follow-ups create clinical risk and liability exposure. Today the quality team) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 367 Tm (reviews a random sample of 3 percent of reports by hand.) Tj
/F1 6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 351 Tm () Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 339 Tm (Reports are written in free text with no structured field for follow-up, and referring) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 323 Tm (doctors are notified only by the report itself.) Tj
/F1 6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 307 Tm () Tj
/F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 295 Tm (3. Objectives) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 276 Tm (Identify at least 95 percent of follow-up recommendations in reports, with a precision) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 260 Tm (of at least 85 percent.) Tj
/F1 6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 244 Tm () Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 232 Tm (Reduce recommended follow-ups with no appointment after 90 days from 27 percent to under) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 216 Tm (10 percent.) Tj
/F1 6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 200 Tm () Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 188 Tm (Reduce quality team review effort by 60 percent.) Tj
/F1 6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 172 Tm () Tj
/F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 160 Tm (4. Must-have features) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 141 Tm (Recommendation detection: read each finalised report and extract the finding, the) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 125 Tm (recommended action, the modality and the recommended time frame, citing the sentence it) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 109 Tm (came from.) Tj
/F1 6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 93 Tm () Tj
